WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:23.000
User prompt as executable specification: UV, git, TDD, commits, and Hypothesis.

00:23.000 --> 00:30.000
Environment and audit trail: git init, uv init, dependencies, first commits.

00:30.000 --> 00:34.000
The κ-Köhler equation becomes a test target.

00:34.000 --> 00:46.000
First RED state: ImportError because the public module does not exist yet.

00:46.000 --> 02:02.000
TDD continues: constants, critical supersaturation, properties, and figure generation.

02:02.000 --> 02:12.000
Figure extraction prompt: render the PDF and isolate Figure 1.

02:12.000 --> 02:25.000
Environment bug: system python unavailable; use uv run python instead.

02:25.000 --> 02:47.000
Digitizing by thresholding and log-axis calibration.

02:47.000 --> 03:17.000
Digitized points become CSV regression tests.

03:17.000 --> 03:30.000
Overlay request: put digitized paper points on the generated curves.

03:30.000 --> 03:48.000
Overlay API bug: unexpected keyword argument drives an interface change.

03:48.000 --> 03:58.000
Final overlay validation: eleven tests pass.

03:58.000 --> 04:49.000
Style pass: make the graph prettier while preserving validation.

04:49.000 --> 05:00.000
Scientific reproduction complete: figure, tests, data, and audit trail.
